  nonce: 2f2a  # 2f2a
  message: "Resolved by PR #3456 / 356c401d8 (masker fix for leading-comment-then-docstring case). The originally-reported issue — the linker matching its OWN source file — is gone: graphql_resolver.py docstring at lines 15-20 was being unmasked due to the SPDX-header bug fixed in WI-vavur's follow-up. Self-analysis confirms: linker source contributed 2 FPs before, 0 after. The 11 remaining graphql_resolver nodes on self-analysis are all in test fixture files (tests/test_graphql_resolver_linker.py and BRANCHES_test_graphql_resolver.py) — those are intentional GraphQL-shaped strings inside test bodies, which the masker correctly preserves (string literals are kept). Test-fixture FPs are a different (less concerning) issue and not what this item described."  # 2f2a
